{"4521920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FYP Ride the Feed", "steam_appid": 4521920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521920/extras/15f3f8ecdb506b65ef83fdf82e997599.poster.avif?t=1783099853\" width=720 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521920/extras/15f3f8ecdb506b65ef83fdf82e997599.webm?t=1783099853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521920/extras/15f3f8ecdb506b65ef83fdf82e997599.mp4?t=1783099853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a flying surfer in this fast-paced 3D bullet hell survival experience where attention is your greatest weapon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You exist inside a strange digital verse where survival depends on both movement and focus. As a Surfer, you gain power by watching videos uploaded by other players, converting watch-time into strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more watch-time you stack, the stronger you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But danger never stops. Each wave of enemies grows harder, forcing you to balance survival with attention management. Watch too little and you fall behind, watch too much and you risk not surviving the wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically spend your watch-time to grow stronger, extend runs, and survive long enough to scale into higher power. Every decision matters, and every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between waves, choose upgrades that shape your build and define your playstyle as difficulty escalates.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521920/extras/bfc43858e70990f6eacc16babfc32c7f.avif?t=1783099853\" width=720 height=180 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced 3D bullet hell survival gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique “watch-time = power” progression system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk-reward mechanics centered around attention management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic wave-based difficulty scaling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build-defining upgrade choices during runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replay-ability through emergent run combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains User Generated Content</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521920/extras/15f3f8ecdb506b65ef83fdf82e997599.poster.avif?t=1783099853\" width=720 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521920/extras/15f3f8ecdb506b65ef83fdf82e997599.webm?t=1783099853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521920/extras/15f3f8ecdb506b65ef83fdf82e997599.mp4?t=1783099853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a flying surfer in this fast-paced 3D bullet hell survival experience where attention is your greatest weapon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You exist inside a strange digital verse where survival depends on both movement and focus. As a Surfer, you gain power by watching videos uploaded by other players, converting watch-time into strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more watch-time you stack, the stronger you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But danger never stops. Each wave of enemies grows harder, forcing you to balance survival with attention management. Watch too little and you fall behind, watch too much and you risk not surviving the wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically spend your watch-time to grow stronger, extend runs, and survive long enough to scale into higher power. Every decision matters, and every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between waves, choose upgrades that shape your build and define your playstyle as difficulty escalates.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521920/extras/bfc43858e70990f6eacc16babfc32c7f.avif?t=1783099853\" width=720 height=180 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced 3D bullet hell survival gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique “watch-time = power” progression system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk-reward mechanics centered around attention management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic wave-based difficulty scaling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build-defining upgrade choices during runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replay-ability through emergent run combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains User Generated Content</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "This game can be used as a tool to watch videos! How long can you survive 'The Feed' while the ad drones do their best to eliminate you? This game is similar to a bullet hell/survival where you defeat waves of enemies and choose your upgrades as you progress.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521920/913f1e276b693b631bd0f18582494c54f8b10757/header.jpg?t=1783099853", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521920/310013727451e03cddf66a1386e0cec80dd00ed6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783099853", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/